---
title: Dates & Events
lede: Feasts, fasts, and parish observances for the church year ahead.
description: Calendar of Orthodox feasts, fasts, and parish events at Saint Elizabeth Orthodox Church in Poulsbo.
---

<p>Our <a href="/what-we-do/worship/">regular weekly schedule</a> changes during certain seasons of the church year. Below are the fixed and movable observances for {{ feasts.year }}.</p>

<ul class="calendar">
  {% for item in feasts.dates %}
    <li>
      <time datetime="{{ item.date }}">{{ item.date | feastDate }}</time>
      <span>{{ item.title }}</span>
      <span class="tag tag-{{ item.kind }}">{{ item.kind }}</span>
    </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>

<p class="notice">
  Dates are maintained in <code>src/_data/feasts.json</code>. Movable feasts follow the date of Pascha
  and must be updated each year.
</p>
